Z||000000||Oreif||06-22-2000||10:12 AM||||Saw this "one owner" pace car on Yahoo. The guy is trying to pass it off as the original pace car from the 1984 Indy 500! He has documents to prove it! (he just took off the custom suspension, wheels, scoop, and put in a stock 2.5L because the 232hp SD4 wasn't fast enough!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> )<BR> <A HREF="http://page.auctions.yahoo.com/auction/30061697" TARGET=_blank>http://page.auctions.yahoo.com/auction/30061697</A> <P><BR>Actually his price for the car isn't bad if it really does have 24,000 miles on it.<P>||||reg||4
